Attributions
============

ledkit-nrf contains no third-party code. The approach (one PWM duty word per
LED bit, played by the PWM sequencer through EasyDMA) is the usual one on the
nRF52, as in the nrf-smartled crate; no code was taken from it. The duty words
and timings come from ledkit-core; see its NOTICE.
